      </div>
      <fieldset style="margin-top:22px"><legend>Authorization</legend>
        <div class="terms">
          <p>I certify that I have read and understand all parts of this application and that I have truthfully and completely answered all questions. I understand that falsification of any information given here or on any other employment form is grounds for immediate termination, regardless of when such falsification is discovered.</p>
          <p>I authorize Quick Mart and its representatives to investigate my education, employment experience, criminal conviction records, and all other aspects of my background relevant to my proposed employment, including all statements made by me in this application. I release Quick Mart and its representatives, as well as any person to whom such inquiry is directed, from any liability arising directly or indirectly from any such investigation.</p>
          <p>I understand that employment is contingent upon successfully passing a pre-employment drug screening (except where prohibited) and that random drug tests may be conducted during employment. I understand my employment with Quick Mart is for no definite length of time and may be terminated at any time, with or without cause. I understand no employee or representative of Quick Mart has authority to make any agreement contrary to the foregoing.</p>
          <p>The complete terms, including the 90-day probationary period, shortage and cash-handling policy, tobacco/lottery/alcohol sales rules, social media and fraternization policies, and indemnification provisions, are set out in the <a href="Quick_Mart_Employment_Application.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">full employment application packet (PDF)</a>. By signing below I confirm I have read them.</p>
        </div>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="agree" required> I have read and agree to the authorization above and the full terms in the employment application packet. <span class="req">*</span></label>
        <div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px">
          <div><label>Type your full legal name as your signature <span class="req">*</span></label><input type="text" name="signature" required autocomplete="off"><div class="signature" id="sigPreview" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
          <div><label>Date <span class="req">*</span></label><input type="date" name="signDate" required></div>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset style="margin-top:22px"><legend>EEOC — voluntary</legend>
        <p class="hint">This information is voluntary and is not used in hiring decisions. It is kept separate from your application.</p>
        <select name="eeoc"><option value="">Prefer not to answer</option><option>Hispanic or Latino</option><option>White (Not Hispanic or Latino)</option><option>Black or African American (Not Hispanic or Latino)</option><option>Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander (Not Hispanic or Latino)</option><option>Asian (Not Hispanic or Latino)</option><option>American Indian or Alaska Native (Not Hispanic or Latino)</option><option>Two or more races (Not Hispanic or Latino)</option></select>
      </fieldset>
      <p class="err" id="err4">Answer the conviction question, check the agreement box, and type your signature and date.</p>
      <div class="panel-nav"><button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-prev>Back</button><button type="button" class="btn" data-next>Review application</button></div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 6 -->
    <div class="panel" data-panel="5">
      <h3>Review & send</h3>
      <p class="hint">Check your answers. When you send, the application is encrypted on your device before it leaves your browser.</p>
      <div class="review" id="review"></div>
      <div id="sendStatus"></div>
      <div class="panel-nav"><button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-prev>Back</button><button type="submit" class="btn" id="sendBtn">Send application</button></div>
    </div>

    </form>
  </div>
</div></section>

